  {"type": "text", "id": "cite", "x": 80, "y": 720, "text": "Sources: #674 Alessandro Cappelli (Adaptive ML) · #247 Yesu Feng (Netflix) · #245 Devansh Tandon (YouTube) · #248 Hamed & Maziar (LinkedIn) · #663 Samuel Humeau (Mistral)\n#677 Dole & Steinskog (Play Magnus) · #918 Quoraishee & Song (NYT) · #755 Schaeff (Google DeepMind) · #406 Alshikh (Writer) · #473 Pekelis (Gradient) · #339 Mason\n#446 Anterior · #187 Wan (Ensemble Health) · #938 Reed & Revere (SonderMind) · #110 Rishabh Garg (Tesla Optimus) · #13 Raia Hadsell (DeepMind) · #267 Jack Rae (DeepMind)", "fontSize": 15, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#475569"}
